{
  "screen_id": "data-descriptor",
  "route": "/research/descriptor",
  "title": "Data Descriptor の記入",
  "layout": "standard",
  "notes": "PPR-03/30 — Data Descriptor 6 節の穴埋め form(field variant=text/number/select)。送信で autoFillDescriptor が観測を節に投影して自動充填し、充足キーは claim を証拠付き(evidenced)に、未検証は仮説(hypothesis)ラベルで表示。LaTeX 禁止(LATEX_FORBIDDEN)。★2026-08-02(g89-w2paper)気づき(未修正・担当外のため報告のみ): この画面のform actionはPOST /api/v1/research/content(research-content-routes.ts)であり、返り値は{content_id,key}のみでclaims/matchを含まない。autoFillDescriptor は実際には POST /api/v1/research/paper-match(paper-match-routes.ts:126)側でのみ呼ばれている。つまりpreview cardの result.claims は現状の配線では常に空(empty_text表示)になる設計不一致がある — 本レーンのスコープ(4画面のscreen-defs実装)を超えるAPI配線判断のため実装はせず、この notes とS4報告書の「気づき」欄に記録するに留めた。★同ラウンドでclaims一覧をlist→table(status列をbadge化)に変更したのは、配線が直った場合に備えた表示側の語彙統一(research-newspaper.json等の既存tableと同型)であり、この不一致自体を解消するものではない。「progressバー」「条件chip分割」(カタログ提案)は、それぞれ①提出後の充足度をサーバから受け取る経路が無い ②conditionsが単一自由記述フィールドで構造化キー入力の新規フィールド型が要る、という理由で既存語彙合成の範囲を超えるため対応を見送った(誇張ゼロ)。",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "shell",
      "type": "app-shell",
      "props": { "page_info": { "purpose": "論文の決まった項目を埋めていく入力画面。観測データから自動で埋まる項目には印が付きます。", "talk_channel": true } },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "page",
          "type": "page",
          "children": [
            { "id": "title", "type": "heading", "props": { "text": "Data Descriptor の記入", "level": 1 } },
            {
              "id": "descriptor-form",
              "type": "form",
              "props": { "header_scoped_producer": true },
              "action": { "kind": "api", "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v1/research/content" },
              "children": [
                { "id": "content-type", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "select", "name": "content_type", "label": "種別", "required": true, "options": [ { "value": "paper", "label": "論文" } ] } },
                { "id": "title-field", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "text", "name": "title", "label": "タイトル", "required": true, "placeholder": "例: ヘラクレスオオカブトの飼育条件" } },
                { "id": "purpose", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "text", "name": "sections.purpose.text", "label": "目的" } },
                { "id": "hypothesis", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "text", "name": "sections.hypothesis.text", "label": "仮説" } },
                { "id": "conditions", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "text", "name": "sections.conditions.text", "label": "条件" } },
                { "id": "verification", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "text", "name": "sections.verification.text", "label": "検証" } },
                { "id": "phase", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "text", "name": "sections.phase.text", "label": "現在のフェーズ" } },
                { "id": "gap", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "text", "name": "sections.gap.text", "label": "ギャップ" } },
                { "id": "completeness", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "number", "name": "completeness_pct", "label": "充足度(0-100)" } },
                { "id": "submit", "type": "button", "props": { "label": "保存して自動充填する", "variant": "primary", "type": "submit" } }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "preview",
              "type": "card",
              "children": [
                { "id": "preview-title", "type": "heading", "props": { "text": "自動充填プレビュー", "level": 2 } },
                {
                  "id": "claims",
                  "type": "table",
                  "props": {
                    "bind_items": "result.claims",
                    "empty_text": "claim はまだありません",
                    "columns": [
                      { "key": "statement", "label": "claim" },
                      { "key": "status", "label": "状態", "cell": "badge" }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
